ps:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Privacy Policy\"}],\"\"]}]]]}]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"section\",\"voiceos-details\",{\"id\":\"voiceos-details\",\"className\":\"mb-16 scroll-mt-28\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"lineHeight\":\"1.3\",\"color\":\"#0a0a0a\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"marginBottom\":\"1.5rem\"},\"children\":\"The VoiceOS setting that changes the answer\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"With Help Improve VoiceOS off, the published VoiceOS policy says raw audio and transcripts are deleted immediately after processing, and user content is not used to train VoiceOS models. Turning the setting on permits evaluation and allows collected audio and transcripts to be retained indefinitely for training. Turning it off later stops future collection under that setting; it does not retrospectively erase earlier contributions.\",[\"$\",\"sup\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"privacy\",{\"href\":\"#source-privacy\",\"className\":\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\",\"aria-label\":\"Source 1\",\"children\":[\"[\",1,\"]\",\"\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Local history is a separate consideration. A copy on your computer can still be visible to someone with access to that computer or included in a backup. Account data, personalization, and integration credentials have their own purposes and retention rules. Read the policy by data category instead of applying the audio rule to every piece of information in the product.\",null]}]]}]],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]\",\"children\":\"Sources \u0026 further reading:\"}],\" \",[[\"$\",\"span\",\"privacy\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/privacy\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS Privacy Policy\"}],\"\"]}]]]}]}]]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"section\",\"three-switches\",{\"id\":\"three-switches\",\"className\":\"mb-16 scroll-mt-28\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"lineHeight\":\"1.3\",\"color\":\"#0a0a0a\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"marginBottom\":\"1.5rem\"},\"children\":\"Three switches that are easy to confuse\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Processing: where is audio turned into text, and where is text edited? Storage: which parts remain after the request, and for how long? Improvement: may any retained content be used to evaluate or train models? Turning off one switch does not necessarily change the other two.\",null]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mx-auto my-8 w-full\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/blogs/guides/editorial/privacy-controls.svg\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"aria-label\":\"View full-size image: Ask separately where audio is processed, what audio or text is retained, and whether data is used to train models.\",\"className\":\"relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"src\":\"/blogs/guides/editorial/privacy-controls.svg\",\"alt\":\"Ask separately where audio is processed, what audio or text is retained, and whether data is used to train models.\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":960,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 920px\",\"className\":\"h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover\",\"style\":\"$undefined\"}]}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]\",\"children\":\"Processing location, retention, and training are separate questions; a single setting may cover only one.\"}],null]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Wispr’s documentation is an example of why that distinction matters: its model-improvement control and Dictation Cloud Storage control are separate. Superwhisper illustrates a different distinction: the speech model and optional language model can run in different places. Read the setting for the exact feature you plan to use.\",[\"$\",\"sup\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"wispr\",{\"href\":\"#source-wispr\",\"className\":\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\",\"aria-label\":\"Source 3\",\"children\":[\"[\",3,\"]\",\" \"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"superprivacy\",{\"href\":\"#source-superprivacy\",\"className\":\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\",\"aria-label\":\"Source 2\",\"children\":[\"[\",2,\"]\",\"\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Screenshots and selected text need the same scrutiny as speech. Context can include a customer’s message, an internal document, or information visible behind the window you meant to discuss. Close unrelated sensitive material and check which context the feature requests. More context is a capability with a data consequence, not a free accuracy upgrade.\",null]}]]}]],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]\",\"children\":\"Sources \u0026 further reading:\"}],\" \",[[\"$\",\"span\",\"wispr\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://wisprflow.ai/privacy\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Privacy and data controls\"}],\" · \"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"superprivacy\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://superwhisper.com/docs/security/sensitive-data\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Sensitive Data Best Practices\"}],\"\"]}]]]}]}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"section\",\"review\",{\"id\":\"review\",\"className\":\"mb-16 scroll-mt-28\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"lineHeight\":\"1.3\",\"color\":\"#0a0a0a\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"marginBottom\":\"1.5rem\"},\"children\":\"A practical privacy review before daily use\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a]\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Write down which kinds of content are allowed: public writing, internal work, client material, or restricted records.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a]\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Record the current privacy mode and any model-improvement switch. Do not rely on the setting you remember from installation.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a]\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Check speech, rewriting, local history, cloud sync, and connected-service permissions separately.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a]\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Read deletion rules for previously collected content; turning off collection is not the same as deleting past data.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a]\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"For a workplace deployment, ask who can enforce the configuration and what the agreement covers.\"}]]}]]}],null]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Test with non-sensitive examples first. A successful draft proves the workflow can work; it does not prove compliance. For a cloud service, ask for the applicable data-processing terms, provider list, and any required report. For a local setup, include backups, logging, and the destination application in the review.\",null]}]]}]],null]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"section\",\"questions\",{\"id\":\"questions\",\"className\":\"mb-16 scroll-mt-28\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"lineHeight\":\"1.3\",\"color\":\"#0a0a0a\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"marginBottom\":\"1.5rem\"},\"children\":\"Questions worth sending to a vendor\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"A specific question is easier to answer than “Are you private?” Ask: “For this plan, with this mode enabled, do you or a processor retain raw audio, intermediate transcripts, final text, screen context, or prompts after the request? Which exception applies to each?” Request a current answer linked to the policy or agreement.\",null]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Then ask what changes when you enable optional improvement, meeting capture, synchronization, or a connected account. These features may cross a boundary that basic dictation does not. The feature you are buying should be the feature your security reviewer evaluates.\",null]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"style\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"If the requirement is that audio never leaves the device, use the offline guide to build a local shortlist. If the requirement is a completed report, request that report and verify its scope. Neither a friendly privacy paragraph nor an audit roadmap satisfies a requirement for evidence.\",null]}]]}]],null]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"related-voiceos-reading\",\"className\":\"mb-16 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":[\"Related: \",[[\"$\",\"span\",\"/blog/best-offline-dictation\",{\"children\":[\"$L2d\",\" · \"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"/blog/best-dictation-software\",{\"children\":[\"$L2e\",\"\"]}]]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":[\"VoiceOS resources: \",[[\"$\",\"span\",\"/pricing\",{\"children\":[\"$L2f\",\" · \"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"/security\",{\"children\":[\"$L30\",\"\"]}]]]}]}]]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"sources\",\"className\":\"mb-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"lineHeight\":\"1.3\",\"color\":\"#0a0a0a\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"marginBottom\":\"1.5rem\"},\"children\":\"Sources and methodology\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-sm text-[#777]\",\"children\":[\"Last updated \",[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"dateTime\":\"2026-09-30T07:00:00.000Z\",\"children\":\"September 30, 2026\"}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-5\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[\"Read the vendors’ published privacy and configuration documentation. Summaries distinguish processing, retention, and model improvement; they do not reproduce broad marketing assurances.\",\" \",\"Limitations: \",\"We did not independently inspect vendor infrastructure, contracts, or network traffic. Policies and feature-specific exceptions can change.\"]}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"list-inside list-decimal space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"privacy\",{\"id\":\"source-privacy\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/privacy\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS Privacy Policy\"}],\" — \",\"VoiceOS\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"superprivacy\",{\"id\":\"source-superprivacy\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://superwhisper.com/docs/security/sensitive-data\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Sensitive Data Best Practices\"}],\" — \",\"Superwhisper\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"wispr\",{\"id\":\"source-wispr\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://wisprflow.ai/privacy\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Privacy and data controls\"}],\" — \",\"Wispr Flow\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"aquaprivacy\",{\"id\":\"source-aquaprivacy\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://aquavoice.com/info/privacy\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Privacy Policy\"}],\" — \",\"Aqua Voice\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"willowprivacy\",{\"id\":\"source-willowprivacy\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://willowvoice.com/privacy-policy\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Privacy Policy\"}],\" — \",\"Willow\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"typelessprivacy\",{\"id\":\"source-typelessprivacy\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.typeless.com/privacy\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Privacy Policy\"}],\" — \",\"Typeless\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"security\",{\"id\":\"source-security\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/security\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS security and privacy\"}],\" — \",\"VoiceOS\"]}]]}]]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-16 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-[#666] md:p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-900\",\"children\":\"How this was made:\"}],\" \",\"Published by VoiceOS, which makes one of the products discussed. AI-assisted research and drafting used the linked sources and VoiceOS product documentation. Recommendations are editorial judgments; examples are illustrative unless explicitly labeled as measured.\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"frequently-asked-questions\",\"className\":\"mb-16 scroll-mt-28\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":\"$27:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Does zero data retention mean nothing leaves my computer?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 md:p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 1.375rem)\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"lineHeight\":\"1.4\",\"color\":\"#0a0a0a\",\"marginBottom\":\"0.5rem\"},\"children\":\"Does zero data retention mean nothing leaves my computer?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[\"No. A cloud provider can process data transiently without retaining it afterward. Offline processing is a separate property.\",null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Does VoiceOS use dictation for training?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 md:p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"style\":\"$29:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Does VoiceOS use dictation for training?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[\"The answer depends on Help Improve VoiceOS. Off means content is not used for VoiceOS training; opting in allows the uses and retention described in Section 4 of the policy.\",[\"$\",\"sup\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"privacy\",{\"href\":\"#source-privacy\",\"className\":\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\",\"aria-label\":\"Source 1\",\"children\":[\"[\",1,\"]\",\"\"]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Can I decide compliance from this comparison?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 md:p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"style\":\"$29:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":\"Can I decide compliance from this comparison?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#444\"},\"children\":[\"No. Use the linked policies and your organization’s requirements. Ask vendors to confirm the exact plan, feature, configuration, processors, and contract terms.\",null]}]]}]]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-[#e5edf8] bg-[#F5F9FF] px-6 py-14 text-[#0a0a0a] md:py-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0\",\"style\":{\"backgroundImage\":\"url(/oceanWarp.webp)\",\"backgroundPosition\":\"center\",\"backgroundSize\":\"cover\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-white/70\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 120% at 50% 50%, transparent 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.85) 100%)\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.375rem, 4vw, 1.75rem)\",\"fontWeight\":600,\"lineHeight\":\"1.3\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\"},\"children\":\"Start with one real task\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9375rem\",\"color\":\"rgba(10,10,10,0.58)\"},\"children\":\"See how VoiceOS handles dictation, editing, and supported app actions on Mac and Windows.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"href\":\"/features/dictation\",\"sourceType\":\"guide\",\"sourceSlug\":\"voice-dictation-privacy\",\"className\":\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-black/[0.06] bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#111] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0_8px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)]\",\"children\":[\"Explore VoiceOS\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeW